# English Linkers & Fillers — full reference

Master list of the linking words + fillers I want to own by Day 30. Each group is mapped to the day it's formally introduced, and to the day it's drilled again (spaced repetition). When any `day-NN.mdc` references linkers, AI should pull the relevant group(s) from this file instead of re-listing them inline.

